      "number": 13,
      "title": "0.14.0",
      "description": "Release focus: consolidate the profiling and checkpoint surface, and end with a checkpoint workflow a pipeline can depend on.\n\n- Done when the acceptance scenario in AndreaBozzo/dataprof-pipeline-reference#1 passes against the release candidate.\n- Config, request resolution, typed errors, API classification: #717 → #719 → #720 (classify and document stability; the freeze comes later).\n- On top of #717: reader and Arrow entry points #884, one format-detection rule #891, with errors that name Arrow IPC and Lance sources #1155. Feature flags with #720: #888.\n- Operating a checkpoint: first run and promotion #1081, null vocabulary per source #846, provenance #866, source column types #906.\n- Gate decisiveness: #788 (bounded per dimension, not full exactness), #830, #1035.\n- Duplicated contracts left by the legacy audit: one `MetricsCalculator` entry #926 (with #717), one Arrow export #927 (with #884).\n- Action v2 needs, moved from 0.13.0: #836 (several sources, one verdict), #849 (policy JSON Schema); the action rewrite (dataprof-action#1) targets this release. Pipeline examples: #842.\n- Baseline gate follow-ups from #749: #1024-#1035, with the reference date #903 first; statistic changes in `compare()` #1153 and the columns a score assessed #1134, both in step 7 of the scenario.\n- Correctness deferred from 0.13.0: #823, #1038, and the PostgreSQL types #1059 now refuses, #1060.\n- Left by the 0.13 audits: route parity #1083; CSV delimiter detection #1094, #1098, #1100; numerics #1089.\n- Also here, not release-defining: bounded locale fixes #809, #815, #816; decision #757.\n\nOpenLineage, the history table, abi3 wheels, CI merges and file splits are in 0.15.0. Composable state is 0.15.0, continuous profiling 0.16.0.\n",
